{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"999b304904e526e723b56433b74f2ace1871bc45e755ef740a0c8f5a961b648c","digest":{"component_or_area":"Gerrit review bot (voter/adapter)","key_entities":["voter.py:366","voter.py:374","voter.py:657","gerrit_client.py:368","app.py:280","review_bot/adapter.py:184","review_bot/adapter.py:6","patchSet.ref","patchSet.revision","FETCH_HEAD","clone_change_ref","repo_root","WEBHOOK_TOKEN","ADR 0009","ADR 0015"],"problem_keywords":["gerrit","review bot","revision","tree binding","assertion","checkout verification"],"propositions":["The review bot fetches a tree from patchSet.ref but votes on patchSet.revision, which are independently-supplied fields that may not correspond to the same commit.","A stale, reused, or partially-fetched clone directory, or a future refactor of checkout logic, can produce a tree that does not match the voted revision with no error signal.","The adapter.py:184 ref parameter is currently unread and must be repurposed to assert that the resolved FETCH_HEAD equals patchSet.revision.","A mismatch between fetched tree and voted revision must refuse to vote and fail closed with an actionable error message.","A test must verify the mismatch detection path to prevent false positives that would block all reviews."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787540476238865001,"uuid":"f0b27de4-a6dc-4684-817e-d96844b50ae0"}